    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'09'24Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 24.09.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2142$11 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 24 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'09'24No. 2142/11 - TUESDAY SEPTEMBER 24, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE MINUWANGODAPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Minuwangoda Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason ofResignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the United National Party, the recognized political party to which AbeysingheLiyanage Udara Rukmal Wijerathna the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaidordinance, to decide upon returned member of United National Party who belongs to such party and is not disqualifiedunder Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within aperiod of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Wijesuriya Arachchige Vishwantha Sadun Wijesuriya to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Karunasinghe Jayarathnage Sampath Madhawa, Returning Officer of the MinuwangodaPradeshiya Sabha, acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) dohereby declare that Wijesuriya Arachchige Vishwantha Sadun Wijesuriya was selected as the member of the MinuwangodaPradeshiya Sabha.\n\nK. J. S. MADHAWA,Returning Officer,Minuwangoda Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Gampaha,23rd September, 2019.\n\n10 - 260\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
