    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2009'12'01PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 01.12.20091AY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2142$14 \u2013 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be 24 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod \u2013 2019'09'24No. 2142/14 \u2013 TUESDAY, SEPTEMBER 24, 2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for apublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of thatAct.\n\nAn allotment of land prepared in advance Tracing No. KE/ARN/2017/110 and dated 31.05.2017 made by the Survey General andsituated in the Village of Moragammana, in the Grama NidladhariDivision of 47C Moragammana, in the Minor Division ofGanhathapalatha, in the Divisional Secretary Division of Aranayaka,in the District of Kegalle, in Sabaragamuwa Province.:\n\n01. Lot A \u2013 Palkumbura \u2013 Extent: 0.0212 HectareNorth: Road (R.D.A); East: Palkumbura; South: Palkumbura andStream;West: Stream.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy No. 4-3/15/2016/SW/416.Divisional Secretary's No. ARA/LND/ACQVI/D3/25.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla,12th August, 2019.\n\n10 \u2013 264\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for apublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act."
