    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'09'24PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 24.09.20191AY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2142$15 \u2013 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be 24 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod \u2013 2019'09'24No. 2142/15 \u2013 TUESDAY, SEPTEMBER 24, 2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are needed fora public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of thatAct.\n\nFollowing described Lots of lands shown in Surveyor Generals'Advance Tracing No. MA/LGG/2001/148 dated 25.12.2001 situatedat Illukkumbura Village (in F. V. P. 20) of Laggala Udasiya PattuMinor Division in Laggala Pallegama DS Division of Matale Districtof Central Province are bounded on:\n\n01. Lot No. 1 \u2013 Panawellawadiya Land \u2013 Extent: 10.5068HectaresNorth: Road and Forest claimed by Government in MahalakotuwaPart; East: Forest claimed by Government in Mahalakotuwa Part,Lot No. 2; South: Lot No. 2 of Forest claimed by Government inMahalakotuwa Part;West: Road.\n\n02. Lot No. 2 \u2013 Panawellawadiya Paddy Field \u2013 Extent: 3.0599HectaresNorth: Lot No. 2 of Forest claimed by Government inMahalakotuwa Part; East: Forest claimed by Government in\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A \u2013 G 31049 \u2013 26 (2019/09)\n\nMahalakotuwa Part; South: Forest claimed by Government inMahalakotuwa Part;West: Lot No. 1.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy No. 13/99/FR/85.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla,29th May, 2019.\n\n10 \u2013 266/1\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)"
