    "chunk_text": "wxl 2142$19 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 24 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'09'24No. 2142/19 \u2013 TUESDAY, SEPTEMBER 24, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lkG 31052 - 17 (09/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4/3/2/M/A/Ma/4.\n\nMinistry of Lands and Parliamentary ReformsReference No.: 4-3/7/2016/HW/391.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, No.28 of 1964, that the Governmentintends to acquire the following land/Servitude which isrequired for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired:\n\nThe allotments of Land, containing in extent of 0.2175Hectare, Lot No: 1 (1 lot) under mentioned land shown in theSurveyor General\u2019s PP No. Ma 1785 dated on 24.07.2019,situated in the village of Pahalawewa in the Grama Niladhari\n\nDivision of Pahalawewa (E 439 A), in Galewela DivisionalSecretary\u2019s Division in Matale District of Central Province.\n\n1. Lot No. 1Name of the Land: Weththiyaya; Description of Land:Paddy field; Claimant: Government; Original Claimants:Rangiri Dambulu Rajamaha Viharaya,Cultivated by EkanayakaMudiyanselage Bulanawewe Gedara Dharmarathne Banda;Extent: 0.2175 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha servitude is to be acquired by are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Galewela Divisional Secretariat, on the day of the 18.10.2019at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me inwriting (in duplicate) on or before the 01.11.2019 the nature oftheir interests in the particulars of their claims for computation"
